cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "KeepOut: celestial keep-out geometry for spacecraft pointing"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "OPTIMA Organisation"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-31
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Sun, Earth and Moon exclusion cones for sensitive spacecraft instruments:
  a boresight violation test with signed clearance margins, allowed-attitude
  region and solid-angle computation, and keep-out-aware pointing windows over
  an orbit. Validation level 1 (educational).
keywords:
  - spacecraft attitude
  - keep-out
  - exclusion cone
  - pointing
  - astrodynamics
